"smart_blocks:30-Resouces/01-Software/14.SVN/配置管理工具---SVN安装及配置.md#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>软件开发的过程是个复杂、耗时、耗力的过程。通常要有很多开发人员参与编写代码。</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>这样就会出现种种代码管理混乱的问题，这些问题容易引发BUG，增加开发人员的工作量，增加软件开发与维护的成本。因此项目中会使用配置工具管理这些代码，解决上诉问题。</span>": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1x2a3d2","at":1781360118552},"key":"30-Resouces/01-Software/14.SVN/配置管理工具---SVN安装及配置.md#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>软件开发的过程是个复杂、耗时、耗力的过程。通常要有很多开发人员参与编写代码。</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>这样就会出现种种代码管理混乱的问题，这些问题容易引发BUG，增加开发人员的工作量，增加软件开发与维护的成本。因此项目中会使用配置工具管理这些代码，解决上诉问题。</span>","lines":[9,475],"size":11391,"outlinks":[{"title":"image1","target":"dfcfbd9803e14d5bad6c3b4124af84ec.png","line":6,"embedded":true},{"title":"image2","target":"4a8eb9917b5447ffbb677bc4f47a6e7e.png","line":22,"embedded":true},{"title":"image3","target":"4e49db76b3ec488db9f3012db768aeac.png","line":26,"embedded":true},{"title":"image4","target":"c83406fcff2249a29bde71bc09236407.png","line":30,"embedded":true},{"title":"image5","target":"907e6fdcf94545d79515067203a6b9e1.png","line":34,"embedded":true},{"title":"image6","target":"c8b3554aca0442ea8046ec90d16c360e.png","line":38,"embedded":true},{"title":"image7","target":"4b326a8739ce4986aa41fe05b4bce625.png","line":42,"embedded":true},{"title":"image8","target":"b1c67d85ef9044b0b93f42834cbb93e0.png","line":46,"embedded":true},{"title":"image9","target":"9f0e13259702494fa425e6a55050549b.png","line":50,"embedded":true},{"title":"image10","target":"463a7f66c82649438c3e99cbb0c67a0f.png","line":54,"embedded":true},{"title":"image11","target":"4ef33a2f04dd4109b064369d830dab9a.png","line":58,"embedded":true},{"title":"image12","target":"2eb91a877961499e87c4223f36c385ae.png","line":61,"embedded":true},{"title":"image13","target":"2af7bdffc985429b99b6df5a895c1902.png","line":64,"embedded":true},{"title":"image14","target":"f4b1179096e44e919cf6f6fcb4a1ada0.png","line":65,"embedded":true},{"title":"image1